WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.710
My honeymoon. And when I told
Moshe that we were doing Israel,

2
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:10.510
Italy and India, the three I's, he's
like, I don't care how much time you

3
00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.500
have in Israel, you're
spending time with me.

4
00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.360
I want to be with you. I want to host you.

5
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.580
I want to spend time
with you and your bride.

6
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:23.950
And not just hosting us, because
obviously he had the Chakra,

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.430
and could have fed us. But he's like,
we're going to go to the best restaurant

8
00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.740
in Jerusalem, the one that
everyone wants to go to.

9
00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:42.990
And he's like, we're going to go
and we're going to drink arak.

10
00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:47.700
Doesn't matter. It's
five o'clock somewhere.

11
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.160
And we're going to celebrate you.
